cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "mcp-safeguard: An Automated Security Scanner for Model Context Protocol (MCP) Servers"
abstract: >-
  mcp-safeguard is an open-source security scanner purpose-built for the Model
  Context Protocol (MCP) ecosystem. It detects Server-Side Request Forgery (SSRF),
  credential exposure, prompt injection, tool poisoning, and security
  misconfigurations across MCP server implementations.
type: software
